WEBVTT

00:03.216 --> 00:05.277
Welcome to the Engine Room Records

00:05.337 --> 00:08.197
Planetarium, and our presentation of

00:08.317 --> 00:11.418
Sanctuary. Having established our initial

00:11.478 --> 00:15.119
tidal lock, our trajectory now brings us to the

00:15.159 --> 00:19.600
periapsis. This is the point in our orbit

00:19.660 --> 00:22.020
closest to the parent body, where

00:22.060 --> 00:25.281
gravitational pull is strongest, and our

00:25.321 --> 00:29.055
velocity reaches its absolute maximum. Please

00:29.115 --> 00:33.157
remain seated as we initiate the orbital

00:33.417 --> 00:34.637
slingshot maneuver.

01:04.413 --> 01:08.254
The shadow grows, the planet swells I'm

01:08.294 --> 01:12.275
dropping down the gravity wells But I'm not here

01:12.635 --> 01:17.736
to crash and burn I'm riding on the massive turn

01:18.616 --> 01:22.457
The telemetry's spinning wild But my

01:22.697 --> 01:27.318
trajectory is perfectly dialed The sequencer

01:27.358 --> 01:33.813
is running hot I'm lining up the perfect shot A

01:33.893 --> 01:38.435
hundred thousand miles an hour Stealing all the

01:38.475 --> 01:42.978
giant's power Periapsis Cutting through the

01:43.018 --> 01:48.921
zone Flying faster than I've ever known Closest

01:49.021 --> 01:53.823
approach Scraping the sky Using the flow just to

01:53.863 --> 01:57.285
watch it fly by We're taking the momentum and

01:57.385 --> 02:02.447
breaking the rope Periapsis Riding the sling

02:02.528 --> 02:03.128
shot out

02:10.071 --> 02:14.253
The atmosphere is brushing the glass A blur of

02:14.353 --> 02:18.995
violet as I pass I feel the frictions start to

02:19.055 --> 02:24.498
heat But I am perfectly on the beat They thought

02:24.538 --> 02:28.259
that gravity would hold me down But I'm just

02:28.480 --> 02:32.822
using it to leave this town The sequencer is

02:32.882 --> 02:37.504
running hot I'm lining up the perfect shot

02:39.283 --> 02:44.265
100,000 miles an hour Stealing all the giant's

02:44.365 --> 02:49.467
power Periapsis Cutting through the zone

02:49.527 --> 02:54.049
Flying faster than I've ever known Closest

02:54.129 --> 02:58.950
approach Scraping the sky Using the pull just to

02:59.010 --> 03:02.352
watch it slide by We're taking the momentum and

03:02.412 --> 03:06.973
breaking the route Periapsis Riding the

03:07.033 --> 03:08.074
slingshot out

03:12.260 --> 03:16.887
Hold your breath at the edge of the wire. Don't

03:16.927 --> 03:21.513
look down at the atmospheric fire. Feel the

03:21.614 --> 03:27.142
apex. Hold the nerve. Slingshot release.

04:06.612 --> 04:10.553
Periapsis Cutting through the zone Flying

04:10.633 --> 04:15.233
faster than I've ever known Closest approach

04:15.894 --> 04:19.954
Scraping the sky Using the spool just to watch it

04:20.054 --> 04:23.595
fly by We're taking the momentum and breaking

04:23.635 --> 04:28.616
the route Periapsis Riding the slingshot out

